#==============================================================================================
#
#   flex_formatting_context_5 - Layout::FlexFormattingContext: aligning the flex lines,
#                               committing the items' boxes and the container's intrinsic sizes
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Layout/FlexFormattingContext.cpp (lines 1645-2068): aligning the flex
#       lines per align-content, copying the items' used sizes, offsets and box model into
#       their used values, the intrinsic main and cross sizes of the flex container
#       (https://drafts.csswg.org/css-flexbox-1/#intrinsic-sizes: desired flex fractions,
#       chosen flex fractions per line) and the main-size min/max-content contributions of an
#       item.
#
#       Copyright (c) 2021-2025, Andreas Kling <andreas@ladybird.org>
#       Copyright (c) 2021, Tobias Christiansen <tobyase@serenityos.org>
#       Copyright (c) 2025, Jelle Raaijmakers <jelle@ladybird.org>
